description=The Scorpion Institute of Technology and Research is one of the leading research and development companies in the world. From medicine all the way to advanced war machines, they do it all. Facility-7 being the forefront of their research and development. <LINE> <LINE> Facility-7 is a large underground site with miles of state of the art research labs and long ominous hallways. The on-site security and private militia keep everything on lock, but don't be fooled, it is a paradise and playground for the world's greatest minds; or atleast, it was, until a bioweapon got released infecting almost the entire facility. <LINE> <LINE> This is the base Facility-7 map with all the Flee Facility-7 challenge spawnpoints. Create your own scenarios and tailor the gameplay to your liking. <LINE> <LINE> The Facility is now your playground..! 